{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10296","headline":"秋夕寄怀契上人 · 皇甫曾","name":"秋夕寄怀契上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已见槿花朝委露，独悲孤鹤在人羣。\n真僧出世心无事，静夜名香手自焚。\n窗临绝涧闻流水，客至孤峯扫白云。\n更想清晨诵经处，独看松上雪纷纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}